px-4 pb-4\n          md:px-8 md:pb-6\n        \"><h4 class=\"text-body-l font-extrabold text-soft-black\">Instructions</h4><div class=\"prose text-body-s\"><ol>\n<li>\n<p>Read, translate, and quip paragraph 1<span class=\"cursor-pointer \n                      cursor-help underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2\n                    \" data-state=\"closed\">*</span>. Do it just like LR.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Take a few seconds to confirm your Translation with the paragraph you just read.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>In this step, you are not rereading from scratch.</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You're confirming the Translation you already have is right.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This style of confirming your Translation with the&nbsp;text applies to every confirmation you ever do on RC.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Repeat this pattern for all remaining paragraphs.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>At the end of the passage, confirm your Translation with the entire passage. This should take 15-30 seconds.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>OPTIONAL</strong>: Look away and recap the FULL TRANSLATION of the entire passage silently.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>This step is optional, but you should do it when you first begin Caffeinated RC Translation Drills and periodically afterward, just to confirm that you can.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Complete this same process on all remaining passages in the section.</p>\n</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><a href=\"/workouts-and-routines/workouts/caffeinated-rc-translation-drill\"><button class=\"\n    inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full\n    font-extrabold uppercase lh-outline\n    [transition:background-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),border-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),box-shadow_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),translate_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]\n    disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\n   \n          border-black text-black\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-x-