]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-y-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#171712]\n         h-[38px] gap-2 text-caption-medium border-[2px] !size-9.5 !gap-0 !px-0 -translate-x-[3px] -translate-y-[3px] shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712] \n          h-8! w-11.5! shrink-0!\n          group-hover/expandable:-translate-x-[3px]\n          group-hover/expandable:-translate-y-[3px]\n          group-hover/expandable:bg-soft-white\n          group-hover/expandable:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          group-has-[[data-no-expand]:hover]/expandable:translate-x-0!\n          group-has-[[data-no-expand]:hover]/expandable:translate-y-0!\n          group-has-[[data-no-expand]:hover]/expandable:shadow-none!\n          peer-hover/bookmark:translate-x-0! peer-hover/bookmark:translate-y-0!\n          peer-hover/bookmark:shadow-none!\n          hover:-translate-x-[3px] hover:-translate-y-[3px] hover:bg-soft-white\n          hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n         \n            shrink-0 self-start\n            lg:h-11! lg:w-15.5\n          \" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close view\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform: rotate(180deg);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-testid=\"lucide-chevron-down-icon\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></span></button></div><div class=\"\n          flex flex-col gap-2 px-4 pb-4\n          md:px-8 md:pb-6\n        \"><h4 class=\"text-body-l font-extrabold text-soft-black\">Instructions</h4><div class=\"prose text-body-s\"><p><strong>NOTE</strong>: The Write In replaces the Mission step of the Full LR Process.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Read and translate the stimulus in chunks<span class=\"cursor-pointer \n                      cursor-help underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2\n                    \" data-state=\"closed\">*</span>.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Quip each chunk of the stimulus after you translate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Continue until the end of the stimulus.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mark the conclusion.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Immediately proceed to the CLIR after your final quip of the stimulus (or the final quip is the CLIR).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Read the question stem, identify the question type and whether the question is Powerful-Provable.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Write in a correct answer to the question.</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Make the Write In answer sound like a real answer choice, not a messy note.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On every individual answer choice:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Read, translate, and quip the answer choice.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Investigate whether this answer choice meets the question type's Back Up Plan.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>If you think this answer meets the Back-Up Plan question, highlight the first word of the answer.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If you are not sure whether this answer meets the Back-Up Plan question, leave it open.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If you know this answer doesn't meet the Back-Up Plan question, cross it out.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Choose amongst the open and highlighted answer choices.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Hyperskip, if needed.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Aim to hyperskip 5-7 questions per section.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Use any remaining time to return to your hyperskips.</p>\n</li>\n</ol></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><a href=\"/workouts-and-routines/workouts/write-in\"><button class=\"\n    inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full\n    font-extrabold uppercase lh-outline\n    [transition:background-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),border-color_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),box-shadow_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1),translate_0.15s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]\n    disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\n   \n          border-black text-black\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-x-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:-translate-y-[3px]\n          hover:not-disabled:shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_#171712]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-x-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:-translate-y-[1px]\n          active:not-disabled:shadow-[1px_1px_0_0_#171712]\n         h-[38px] gap-2 text-caption-medium border-[2px] pl-4 pr-3\">See full workout details<span class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"12\" class=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 19\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-testid=\"arrow-icon\"><path d=\"M20.25 10.9383H1.66667C1.19444 10.9383 0.798611 10.7786 0.479167 10.4592C0.159722 10.1397 0 9.74389 0 9.27167C0 8.79945 0.159722 8.40361 0.479167 8.08417C0.798611 7.76472 1.19444 7.605 1.66667 7.605H20.25L15.5 2.855C15.1667 2.52167 15.0069 2.13278 15.0208 1.68833C15.0347 1.24389 15.1944 0.855 15.5 0.521667C15.8333 0.188333 16.2292 0.0147222 16.6875 0.000833333C17.1458 -0.0130556 17.5417 0.146667 17.875 0.48L25.5 8.105C25.6667 8.27167 25.7847 8.45222 25.8542 8.64667C25.9236 8.84111 25.9583 9.04945 25.9583 9.27167C25.9583 9.49389 25.9236 9.70222 25.8542 9.89667C25.7847 10.0911 25.6667 10.2717 25.5 10.4383L17.875 18.0633C17.5417 18.3967 17.1458 18.5564 16.6875 18.5425C16.2292 18.5286 15.8333 18.355 15.5 18.0217C15.1944 17.6883 15.0347 17.2994 15.0208 16.855C15.0069 16.4106 15.1667 16.0217 15.5 15.6883L20.25 10.9383Z\" fill=\"#171712\"></path></svg></span></button></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
